<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 640 904" width="640" height="904" role="img" aria-labelledby="t d"><title id="t">The eight Tube driver strike windows, Nov 2026 to Feb 2027</title><desc id="d">Eight strikes, each from 12:00 to 11:59 the next day: 26 to 27 Nov 2026; 17 to 18 Dec; 19 to 20 Dec; 4 to 5 Jan 2027; 6 to 7 Jan; 17 to 18 Feb; 23 to 24 Feb; 25 to 26 Feb. {{state}} On the first strike there is no service on the Circle and Piccadilly lines all day, none on Waterloo and City after 12:00, disruption on all other Tube lines from about 12:00, and the Elizabeth line, DLR, Overground, buses and trams are expected to run. Line detail for the other seven strikes has not been published.</desc><defs><pattern id="hat" width="6" height="6" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(45)"><rect width="3" height="6" class="fl"/></pattern></defs><style>.bg{fill:#f6f3ec}.i{fill:#121317}.n{fill:#595c64}.hs{stroke:#d9d2c1}.ms{stroke:#3f424a}.fl{fill:#121317}.ol{fill:#f6f3ec;stroke:#121317;stroke-width:2}.pa{fill:#121317;opacity:.4}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.bg{fill:#121317}.i{fill:#f6f3ec}.n{fill:#b4b6ad}.hs{stroke:#34353a}.ms{stroke:#d6d3cb}.fl{fill:#f6f3ec}.ol{fill:#121317;stroke:#f6f3ec}.pa{fill:#f6f3ec;opacity:.4}}text{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",ui-monospace,monospace}.t{font-family:"Newsreader",Georgia,serif}</style><rect class="bg" width="640" height="904"/><rect x="28" y="28" width="96" height="8" fill="#006600"/><text class="t i" x="28" y="76" font-size="30" font-weight="600">The eight Tube strike windows</text><text class="t n" x="28" y="106" font-size="20" font-style="italic">Each from 12:00 to 11:59 the next day, Nov 2026 to Feb 2027</text><line class="hs" x1="325.0" x2="325.0" y1="132" y2="502" stroke-width="1"/><line class="hs" x1="423.9" x2="423.9" y1="132" y2="502" stroke-width="1"/><line class="hs" x1="522.7" x2="522.7" y1="132" y2="502" stroke-width="1"/><line class="hs" x1="612.0" x2="612.0" y1="132" y2="502" stroke-width="1"/><text class="n" x="293.6" y="144" font-size="14">Nov</text><text class="n" x="328.6" y="144" font-size="14">Dec</text><text class="n" x="427.4" y="144" font-size="14">Jan</text><text class="n" x="526.3" y="144" font-size="14">Feb</text><text class="n" x="28" y="173" font-size="14">1</text><text class="i" x="52" y="173" font-size="15">Thu 26 Nov to Fri 27 Nov</text><rect class="fl" x="309.1" y="160" width="8.0" height="18"/><text class="n" x="28" y="217" font-size="14">2</text><text class="i" x="52" y="217" font-size="15">Thu 17 Dec to Fri 18 Dec</text><rect class="ol" x="376.1" y="204" width="8.0" height="18"/><text class="n" x="28" y="261" font-size="14">3</text><text class="i" x="52" y="261" font-size="15">Sat 19 Dec to Sun 20 Dec</text><rect class="ol" x="382.4" y="248" width="8.0" height="18"/><text class="n" x="28" y="305" font-size="14">4</text><text class="i" x="52" y="305" font-size="15">Mon 4 Jan to Tue 5 Jan</text><rect class="ol" x="433.5" y="292" width="8.0" height="18"/><text class="n" x="28" y="349" font-size="14">5</text><text class="i" x="52" y="349" font-size="15">Wed 6 Jan to Thu 7 Jan</text><rect class="ol" x="439.9" y="336" width="8.0" height="18"/><text class="n" x="28" y="393" font-size="14">6</text><text class="i" x="52" y="393" font-size="15">Wed 17 Feb to Thu 18 Feb</text><rect class="ol" x="573.8" y="380" width="8.0" height="18"/><text class="n" x="28" y="437" font-size="14">7</text><text class="i" x="52" y="437" font-size="15">Tue 23 Feb to Wed 24 Feb</text><rect class="ol" x="592.9" y="424" width="8.0" height="18"/><text class="n" x="28" y="481" font-size="14">8</text><text class="i" x="52" y="481" font-size="15">Thu 25 Feb to Fri 26 Feb</text><rect class="ol" x="599.3" y="468" width="8.0" height="18"/><text class="n" x="28" y="536" font-size="13">Solid: under way. Faded: ended. Outlined: announced; dates after the first may change.</text><line class="ms" x1="28" x2="612" y1="552" y2="552" stroke-width="1"/><text class="t i" x="28" y="582" font-size="24" font-weight="600">Strike 1 by line: Thu 26 Nov</text><g transform="translate(28,606)"><rect class="fl" width="24" height="22"/></g><text class="t i" x="64" y="617" font-size="18" font-weight="600">Circle and Piccadilly</text><text class="n" x="64" y="636" font-size="14">No service all day</text><g transform="translate(28,664)"><rect class="ol" x="1" y="1" width="22" height="20"/><rect class="fl" width="12" height="22"/></g><text class="t i" x="64" y="675" font-size="18" font-weight="600">Waterloo &amp; City</text><text class="n" x="64" y="694" font-size="14">No service after 12:00</text><g transform="translate(28,722)"><rect class="ol" x="1" y="1" width="22" height="20"/><rect x="1" y="1" width="22" height="20" fill="url(#hat)"/></g><text class="t i" x="64" y="733" font-size="18" font-weight="600">All other Tube lines</text><text class="n" x="64" y="752" font-size="14">Disruption from about 12:00</text><g transform="translate(28,780)"><rect class="ol" x="1" y="1" width="22" height="20"/></g><text class="t i" x="64" y="791" font-size="18" font-weight="600">Elizabeth line, DLR, Overground, buses, trams</text><text class="n" x="64" y="810" font-size="14">Expected to run, possibly busier</text><text class="n" x="28" y="856" font-size="13">Line detail for strikes 2 to 8 to come: TfL has not published it.</text><text class="n" x="28" y="878" font-size="13">Source: TfL press release PN-259, 23 Nov 2026, read 26 Nov 2026.</text></svg>
